{
  "work_id": "wb-glosses/titus",
  "source_path": "wb-glosses/titus.json",
  "source_language": "sga",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-01",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31a.6",
      "source_sha256": "0a6aeb4389add264",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. my faith is not contrary to the faith of those who have believed well in Christ; or, \"that the faith of the saints of God may grow.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31a.7",
      "source_sha256": "6174cba14fb41352",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "What he has promised here, then, will not be a lie, [?] all that he says."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31a.8",
      "source_sha256": "ed056c253067434c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it existed beforehand."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31a.9",
      "source_sha256": "39534121389f0336",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The life that he promised, that is the word which he revealed when he judged the time was right."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31a.10",
      "source_sha256": "4a55b787b6926a56",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is by his will that it has been entrusted to me, as in \"Separate for me Paul and Barnabas,\" etc.; or, \"Go, teach all.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31a.11",
      "source_sha256": "42d93cabbf581692",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which is between us"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.1",
      "source_sha256": "2682a7539e835e36",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. I have left you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.2",
      "source_sha256": "665139dfbde36c6f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. of our faith"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.3",
      "source_sha256": "be271a61914bdcc4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. ordaining, conferring orders"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.4",
      "source_sha256": "6f3aec03bae1940c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Before ordination and after baptism; it is more illustrious to say [it] afterwards [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.5",
      "source_sha256": "55777a758e9645de",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that his children may not be lustful; or, that he may not be accused by others of luxury."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.6",
      "source_sha256": "59f013271b404ad1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. under the authority of their parents"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.7",
      "source_sha256": "d2d821facddad20e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for it is a fault in him if his household is bad"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.8",
      "source_sha256": "125e2024279e72bc",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for sin would not be fitting for him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.9",
      "source_sha256": "76f2d55e512348a4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who drinks too much [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.10",
      "source_sha256": "09e3757e63dcf336",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "so that he may examine whatever he teaches for the healing of everyone"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.11",
      "source_sha256": "3125981191c45cff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. only then is he able to exhort, provided that he has fulfilled it before he preaches it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.12",
      "source_sha256": "3b952965f165d588",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. which heals body and soul"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.13",
      "source_sha256": "aa03dfe8f7562906",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Thus far the qualities of the bishop."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.14",
      "source_sha256": "0beac36051e502c7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. who boast of tales and histories of the Law and of paganism"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.15",
      "source_sha256": "ce076e2ecafcc78c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that is, of the Jews"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.16",
      "source_sha256": "2da09a7727d7e240",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. from faith into unbelief"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.17",
      "source_sha256": "44334d775056d6aa",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. what they teach is not fit for sanctification"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.18",
      "source_sha256": "851850f359177ecb",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they seek the wealth of the world"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.19",
      "source_sha256": "7c0b3d4d68191127",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. Epimenides or Callimachus. See the testimony that their own poet gave, so that it may suit their knowledge and their teaching."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.20",
      "source_sha256": "c3e435696c04d38d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. they follow falsehoods for the sake of greed"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.21",
      "source_sha256": "bbf92b97be1975d1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. evil beasts in shedding blood, because of their cruelty"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.22",
      "source_sha256": "8daf4e7cb6d24331",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. full-bellied, or gluttonous"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.23",
      "source_sha256": "6d1ca256e3a96ba6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "lazy, i.e. at service; constant in begging for meals"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.24",
      "source_sha256": "5def15f6061f869c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. because of these four things"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.25",
      "source_sha256": "2fe54340d4a614d9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "it is so that they may be good that they are corrected"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.25a",
      "source_sha256": "39718a4ec3396d6c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "stories and old tales and ordinances"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.26",
      "source_sha256": "87571fd9d1f5d31d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. members, i.e. mind, body, soul, [?] deeds"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.27",
      "source_sha256": "16f7a671c804b406",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. unless their mind is clean, and a clean conscience"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.28",
      "source_sha256": "ff6895bc5d93d2ff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "nothing clean"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.29",
      "source_sha256": "e8985a0afb63e1a9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "their mind and their conscience are defiled"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.30",
      "source_sha256": "dd2d5ed6d18b9bab",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "their deeds contradict their words"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.31",
      "source_sha256": "b55e6763c0dbaffd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. because they do not fulfil what they preach"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.32",
      "source_sha256": "f0e7486666196760",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "what is fitting to God"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.33",
      "source_sha256": "cb59b92694a2d256",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "after fulfilling it"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.34",
      "source_sha256": "2a7b9eb308d8f864",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. which heals body and soul"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.35",
      "source_sha256": "7db43346ad2fa2bd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. a sober old man is a beautiful thing"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31b.36",
      "source_sha256": "2a313a78bd1ee4cf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "without sin"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.1",
      "source_sha256": "70eaebec913b0350",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that they [?] what is not holy"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.2",
      "source_sha256": "1798fdf5af522e90",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for themselves and for anyone else"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.3",
      "source_sha256": "f0947e96680bfb4f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. for drunkenness does not befit a nun"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.4",
      "source_sha256": "fb592aae80e73ad4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "through instruction"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.5",
      "source_sha256": "e1b0ecc62ff25f51",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "in borrowing and lending"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.6",
      "source_sha256": "3e35ee3e7c235e12",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. in all humility"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.7",
      "source_sha256": "8badb313b6844a89",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. lest it be said: \"Since they have believed, our wives are not under our control\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.8",
      "source_sha256": "ff8992b6136309a8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that everyone may take an example from your deeds."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.9",
      "source_sha256": "1c4a6d8acb18bc30",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "These are the good works."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.10",
      "source_sha256": "3bde6f7f19d8d73c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that they may be respected [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.11",
      "source_sha256": "1a86edc6c28ff278",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If we are like this, i.e. if we fulfil what we preach and are an example to everyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.12",
      "source_sha256": "b50ba31aa7f52cf0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that they should not take what is entrusted to them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.13",
      "source_sha256": "934162ab00629935",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. that they should be pure toward everything."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.14",
      "source_sha256": "ef729dcfea8c39b2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. so that every rank may fulfil it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.15",
      "source_sha256": "96a3ce395fd5970c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Let everyone come to the teaching of Christ, for it is not a sin for him [?]; its guide [?] is behind everyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.16",
      "source_sha256": "e050d35d930a38b2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "It is for this that he teaches us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.17",
      "source_sha256": "7be10fff3044ade4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "While we wait."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.18",
      "source_sha256": "2bed0d6baf030ff0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. there was something there to be cleansed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.19",
      "source_sha256": "87d99a5b1725d64a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In the union of the body of Christ."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.20",
      "source_sha256": "6ba09dff1ba149d2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Preach."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.21",
      "source_sha256": "2d93ccf9f756a699",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "With the authority of an apostle."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.22",
      "source_sha256": "7f24157ca9e315b4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. let it not hold you back [?] from declaring his sin to everyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.23",
      "source_sha256": "ecfdc0bb95e02a95",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Whether they deserve it or do not deserve it, i.e. to friends and to enemies."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.24",
      "source_sha256": "740059b031b9ae65",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Gentleness is fitting in the teaching: 'for we were,' etc."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31c.25",
      "source_sha256": "1ee21a7416dfd36c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. for the Law did not prevent it in us."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.1",
      "source_sha256": "d81996017b0f8f8c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. according to the custom of the Law [?] manetar [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.2",
      "source_sha256": "22890a84cf8609af",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. it is out of great love that Christ came to take on flesh."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.3",
      "source_sha256": "dd9567d10708ae98",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His taking on of flesh."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.4",
      "source_sha256": "792ebb808e848362",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. not by works of the righteousness of the Law."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.5",
      "source_sha256": "78d7c04a289dc731",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Before the appearance of God, what righteousness did we have [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.6",
      "source_sha256": "dc073897a6904cf0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "i.e. yet it is not for the righteousness of the Law that he saved us, but out of his mercy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.7",
      "source_sha256": "169e4f54aa537176",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "To everyone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.8",
      "source_sha256": "b89d9ef6e5084dbe",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "i.e. because they are in the faith"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.9",
      "source_sha256": "04ba87a3138cdcf3",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "i.e. they are not useful to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.10",
      "source_sha256": "b85c022f5cc8cafd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "i.e. they bring no profit"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.11",
      "source_sha256": "a57cb0069dac9ae5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "i.e. lest he draw you [?], in return for correcting him, into anything further [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.12",
      "source_sha256": "02eb3100590b9fbf",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "who does not do anything that he is taught"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.13",
      "source_sha256": "a5b0eda14aa99c32",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "i.e. to remain in your place, so that they might not be left without a teacher"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.14",
      "source_sha256": "43434912949d8b84",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "i.e. for I have decided to be there this winter"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.15",
      "source_sha256": "7ad16b5c59f79b24",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "to teach them, for they were learned in teaching"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.16",
      "source_sha256": "660f1ff82a5097c1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "i.e. even our own people, though"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.17",
      "source_sha256": "97537ba0ec6e9ef2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "i.e. as is needed for feeding the teachers, or as is needed for the perfecting of the good works of the teachers themselves"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "wb-glosses/titus#Wb.31d.18",
      "source_sha256": "95504a5205e5a45e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-01",
      "group_size": 11,
      "text": "greeting is brought to you from them"
    }
  ]
}
